{"pageid":2086,"title":"Junior Scientist","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Junior Scientist</span>","revid":9225,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default type-wood\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Junior Scientist</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/7/74/Junior_Scientist.png/revision/latest?cb=20240112155033\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Junior Scientist\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/7/74/Junior_Scientist.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20240112155033\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/7/74/Junior_Scientist.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20240112155033 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/7/74/Junior_Scientist.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20240112155033 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Junior Scientist\" width=\"270\" height=\"169\" data-image-key=\"Junior_Scientist.png\" data-image-name=\"Junior Scientist.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tStats\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Finlay_Island\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Finlay Island\">Finlay Island</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\nThe <b>Junior Scientist</b> (written in game as <b>Jr. Scientist</b>) is a NPC located on <a href=\"/wiki/Finlay_Island\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Finlay Island\">Finlay Island</a>. She is a budding astronomer.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The Junior Scientist can be found by taking the right turn just before crossing the drawbridge, then taking a left turn before crossing the small arched bridge leading to the northern part of Finlay Island. There is a small rock ledge that can be climbed up to reach the Junior Scientist.\n</p><p>Talking to the Junior Scientist will cause her to explain that she is \"... a scientist! Well... Future scientist!\" She explains that she and Giggles (the non-interactible rat standing beside her) are out looking for meteor showers. Should the player ask to know when the next meteor is coming, she will \"ask Giggles what he thinks\" before demanding the player pay $3,500. If the player pays up, she will give the number of minutes before the next meteor spawns. If the player declines, she will express her disappointment, saying that she \"wanted a new telescope\".\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Dialog\">Dialog</span></h2>\n<p><i>Interacting with the Junior Scientist:</i>\n</p>\n<dl><dd>\"Hello I'm a scientist! Well... Future scientist! I love science, don't you? Me and Giggles are looking out for a meteor shower!\"</dd></dl>\n<ul><li>If the player selects \"Cool..?\": <i>Dialog ends</i></li>\n<li>If the player selects \"When's the next meteor?\":<br />\"Hmmm, let me ask Giggles what he thinks... We don't tell strangers right away! *snickers* OK! WE HAVE CAME TO THE DECISION. $3,500 AND I'LL TELL YOU\"</li>\n<li><i>If the player selects \"No thanks\":</i><br />\"Aww... I wanted a new telescope...\"</li>\n<li><i>If the player selects \"Deal\":</i><br />\"AWWW TYSM!!! You are so sweet. The next meteor will be in ~[number] minutes!\"<br /><i>Player loses $3,500.</i></li></ul>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible\" style=\"background:#291F1D; width:100%; padding:.1em; margin:.5em auto; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\" data-expandtext=\"Open\" data-collapsetext=\"Close\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:105px; background:#140401; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\"><span style=\"float:left; padding-left:10px; padding-top:4px; font-size:90%\"><a href=\"/wiki/Template:NPC_Nav\" title=\"Template:NPC Nav\"><span title=\"View this template\">v</span></a> • <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Template_talk:NPC_Nav\"><span title=\"Discuss this template\">d</span></a> • <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Template:NPC_Nav?action=edit\"><span title=\"Edit this template\">e</span></a></span><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Oaklands\" title=\"Oaklands Wiki\"><img alt=\"Oaklands Wiki\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/e/e6/Site-logo.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/115?cb=20221025233312\" decoding=\"a